    "text": "Is there a normal valued l-group G for which there is no abelian l-group A\nwith C(A) ∼ = C(G)? (Here C(G) denotes the lattice of convex l-subgroups of G. If G\nis not required to be normal valued, this question has an affirmative answer.)\n                                                                           S. McCleary",
